<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2000"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">以无敌的笑容 席卷媒体</text><text for="L2">想知道那个秘密 神秘莫测</text><text for="L3">连犯迷糊的地方 都是她的领域</text><text for="L4">完美又爱撒谎的你</text><text for="L5">是天才偶像大人</text><text for="L6">今天吃了什么？</text><text for="L7">喜欢什么书？</text><text for="L8">要出去玩的话 会去哪里呢？</text><text for="L9">什么都没吃</text><text for="L10">那是秘密</text><text for="L11">无论被问到什么</text><text for="L12">都含糊带过</text><text for="L13">那样淡然</text><text for="L14">却又灿然生辉</text><text for="L15">若隐若现的秘密 是蜜的滋味</text><text for="L16">那个也没有 没有没有</text><text for="L17">这个也没有 没有没有</text><text for="L18">喜欢的类型是？</text><text for="L19">对象呢？</text><text for="L20">来吧 回答我</text><text for="L21">「喜欢上谁这种事 我根本不懂啊」</text><text for="L22">是谎言还是真话 无从得知</text><text for="L23">那样的话语 又让一人沦陷</text><text for="L24">又一次 让人为她倾心</text><text for="L25">所有人的目光 都被夺走</text><text for="L26">你是完美无缺的终极偶像</text><text for="L27">永远都不会再出现</text><text for="L28">那颗初星的转世</text><text for="L29">凭那笑容 凭那句「我爱你」</text><text for="L30">让所有人 都成了俘虏</text><text for="L31">那双眼睛 那些话语</text><text for="L32">哪怕是谎言 那也是完美的爱</text><text for="L33">好好好 那孩子是特别的</text><text for="L34">我们打从一开始 就是附赠品</text><text for="L35">不过是衬托星星的B角</text><text for="L36">不可能全部 都是那孩子的功劳</text><text for="L37">真够臭美的</text><text for="L38">怎么可能没有嫉妒</text><text for="L39">这可不是开玩笑</text><text for="L40">正因如此 才无法原谅</text><text for="L41">不完美的你 无法原谅</text><text for="L42">无法原谅自己</text><text for="L43">除了比谁都强大的你 谁都不承认</text><text for="L44">所有人都相信着 崇拜着</text><text for="L45">正是最强无敌的偶像</text><text for="L46">弱点什么的 根本找不到</text><text for="L47">体内寄宿着那颗初星</text><text for="L48">软弱的样子 绝不能让人看到 不行不行</text><text for="L49">不想让人知道的地方 绝不示人</text><text for="L50">必须独一无二 不行不行</text><text for="L51">那才正是 真正的爱</text><text for="L52">用拿手的笑容 让媒体沸腾</text><text for="L53">唯独这个秘密 要彻底藏好</text><text for="L54">用「我爱你」的谎言 堆砌起的职业生涯</text><text for="L55">这正是 我自己的爱</text><text for="L56">流下的汗水 也如美丽的水</text><text for="L57">将露比藏在眼底的 这双眼睑</text><text for="L58">歌唱起舞的我 是玛利亚</text><text for="L59">没错 谎言就是极致的爱</text><text for="L60">我从未被谁爱过</text><text for="L61">也从未爱过谁</text><text for="L62">我的那些谎言 终有一天会成真</text><text for="L63">我深信着</text><text for="L64">总有一天 一定会全部得到</text><text for="L65">我 就是如此贪婪的偶像</text><text for="L66">因为想以最真实的自己</text><text for="L67">好好地爱着大家</text><text for="L68">所以今天 也在说谎</text><text for="L69">祈祷着这句话 成真的那天</text><text for="L70">即便如此 仍然</text><text for="L71">唯独对你们俩 一直没能说出口</text><text for="L72">终于说出来了</text><text for="L73">这绝对 不是谎言</text><text for="L74">我爱你</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>Ayase</songwriter></songwriters><transliterations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><transliteration xml:lang="ja-Latn" xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata"><text for="L1"><span begin="0:00.589" end="0:01.396">mu teki no </span><span begin="0:01.396" end="0:01.866">e gao </span><span begin="0:01.866" end="0:02.045">de </span><span begin="0:02.045" end="0:02.346">ara su </span><span begin="0:02.346" end="0:02.799">medi</span><span begin="0:02.799" end="0:03.197">a</span></text><text for="L2"><span begin="0:03.491" end="0:04.089">shi ri tai </span><span begin="0:04.089" end="0:04.472">so no </span><span begin="0:04.472" end="0:04.915">hi mitsu </span><span begin="0:04.915" end="0:05.310">misu</span><span begin="0:05.310" end="0:05.721">teri</span><span begin="0:05.721" end="0:06.075">asu</span></text><text for="L3"><span begin="0:06.075" end="0:06.741">nu ke te ru </span><span begin="0:06.741" end="0:07.502">toko sae </span><span begin="0:07.502" end="0:08.102">kano jo no </span><span begin="0:08.102" end="0:08.570">eri</span><span begin="0:08.570" end="0:08.873">a</span></text><text for="L4"><span begin="0:09.291" end="0:10.000">kan peki </span><span begin="0:10.000" end="0:10.260">de </span><span begin="0:10.260" end="0:10.624">uso</span><span begin="0:10.624" end="0:11.112">tsuki na </span><span begin="0:11.112" end="0:11.402">kimi </span><span begin="0:11.402" end="0:11.740">wa</span></text><text for="L5"><span begin="0:11.891" end="0:12.553">ten sai </span><span begin="0:12.553" end="0:13.169">teki na </span><span begin="0:13.169" end="0:13.850">ai do ru </span><span begin="0:13.850" end="0:14.557">sama</span></text><text for="L6"><span begin="0:17.238" end="0:17.628">kyou </span><span begin="0:17.628" end="0:17.957">nani </span><span begin="0:17.957" end="0:18.301">tabe</span><span begin="0:18.301" end="0:18.602">ta</span></text><text for="L7"><span begin="0:18.873" end="0:19.402">suki na </span><span begin="0:19.402" end="0:19.710">hon </span><span begin="0:19.710" end="0:20.021">wa</span></text><text for="L8"><span begin="0:20.338" end="0:21.069">aso bi ni </span><span begin="0:21.069" end="0:21.766">iku nara </span><span begin="0:21.766" end="0:22.612">doko ni iku </span><span begin="0:22.612" end="0:22.997">no</span></text><text for="L9"><span begin="0:23.192" end="0:23.602">nani mo </span><span begin="0:23.602" end="0:24.178">ta be te </span><span begin="0:24.178" end="0:24.444">nai</span></text><text for="L10"><span begin="0:24.677" end="0:25.287">so re wa </span><span begin="0:25.287" end="0:25.826">nai sho</span></text><text for="L11"><span begin="0:26.093" end="0:26.634">nani o </span><span begin="0:26.634" end="0:27.414">ki ka re te </span><span begin="0:27.414" end="0:27.525">mo</span></text><text for="L12"><span begin="0:27.550" end="0:28.160">no ra ri </span><span begin="0:28.160" end="0:28.754">ku ra ri</span></text><text for="L13"><span begin="0:28.758" end="0:29.278">sou </span><span begin="0:29.278" end="0:29.942">tan tan to</span></text><text for="L14"><span begin="0:30.073" end="0:30.678">da ke do </span><span begin="0:30.678" end="0:31.409">san san to</span></text><text for="L15"><span begin="0:31.491" end="0:32.092">mi e sou de </span><span begin="0:32.092" end="0:32.837">mi e nai </span><span begin="0:32.837" end="0:33.135">hi mitsu </span><span begin="0:33.135" end="0:33.568">wa </span><span begin="0:33.568" end="0:33.905">mitsu </span><span begin="0:33.905" end="0:34.090">no </span><span begin="0:34.090" end="0:34.459">aji</span></text><text for="L16"><span begin="0:34.488" end="0:34.966">a re mo </span><span begin="0:34.966" end="0:35.710">nai nai nai</span></text><text for="L17"><span begin="0:35.809" end="0:36.469">ko re mo </span><span begin="0:36.469" end="0:37.196">nai nai nai</span></text><text for="L18"><span begin="0:37.325" end="0:38.181">suki na taipu </span><span begin="0:38.181" end="0:38.410">wa</span></text><text for="L19"><span begin="0:38.460" end="0:38.992">aite </span><span begin="0:38.992" end="0:39.096">wa</span></text><text for="L20"><span begin="0:39.123" end="0:39.471">saa </span><span begin="0:39.528" end="0:40.071">kotae</span><span begin="0:40.071" end="0:40.397">te</span></text><text for="L21"><span begin="0:40.346" end="0:40.446"></span><span begin="0:40.446" end="0:40.871">dare</span><span begin="0:40.871" end="0:41.048">ka </span><span begin="0:41.048" end="0:41.302">o </span><span begin="0:41.302" end="0:42.023">suki </span><span begin="0:42.023" end="0:42.338">ni </span><span begin="0:42.338" end="0:42.752">naru </span><span begin="0:42.752" end="0:43.101">koto </span><span begin="0:43.298" end="0:43.872">nante </span><span begin="0:44.069" end="0:44.607">watashi </span><span begin="0:44.732" end="0:45.862">wa ka ra na ku te </span><span begin="0:45.862" end="0:46.107">sa</span></text><text for="L22"><span begin="0:46.205" end="0:46.578"