 begin="1:04.160" end="1:04.655">boshi </span><span begin="1:04.655" end="1:04.885">no </span><span begin="1:04.885" end="1:05.412">u ma re</span><span begin="1:05.412" end="1:05.726">ka</span><span begin="1:05.726" end="1:06.265">wa ri</span></text><text for="L29"><span begin="1:07.310" end="1:07.721">so no </span><span begin="1:07.721" end="1:08.215">e gao </span><span begin="1:08.215" end="1:08.491">de </span><span begin="1:08.724" end="1:09.122">ai</span><span begin="1:09.122" end="1:09.695">shi te ru </span><span begin="1:09.695" end="1:10.015">de</span></text><text for="L30"><span begin="1:10.028" end="1:11.263">dare mo kare mo </span><span begin="1:11.263" end="1:11.830">toriko </span><span begin="1:11.830" end="1:12.492">ni shite i</span><span begin="1:12.492" end="1:12.912">ku</span></text><text for="L31"><span begin="1:13.014" end="1:13.451">so no </span><span begin="1:13.451" end="1:13.998">hitomi </span><span begin="1:13.998" end="1:14.325">ga </span><span begin="1:14.586" end="1:15.254">so no koto ba </span><span begin="1:15.254" end="1:15.446">ga</span></text><text for="L32"><span begin="1:15.462" end="1:15.920">uso </span><span begin="1:15.920" end="1:16.821">demo so re wa </span><span begin="1:16.821" end="1:17.566">kan zen na </span><span begin="1:17.566" end="1:18.265">ai</span></text><text for="L33"><span begin="1:18.799" end="1:19.399">hai hai </span><span begin="1:19.399" end="1:20.105">a no ko wa </span><span begin="1:20.105" end="1:20.754">toku betsu </span><span begin="1:20.754" end="1:21.199">desu</span></text><text for="L34"><span begin="1:21.633" end="1:22.474">ware ware wa </span><span begin="1:22.474" end="1:23.153">hana kara </span><span begin="1:23.153" end="1:23.759">o ma ke </span><span begin="1:23.759" end="1:24.049">desu</span></text><text for="L35"><span begin="1:24.146" end="1:24.679">o hoshi</span><span begin="1:24.679" end="1:25.212">sama no </span><span begin="1:25.212" end="1:26.210">hi ki ta te yaku </span><span begin="1:26.